{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy for calm, clarity, and resilience</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Practical aromatherapy sessions, blends and a VIP Day to build an at-home wellness ritual. Safety-forward guidance, no medical claims.'>
  <link rel='stylesheet' href='assets/css/styles.css'>
  <script defer src='assets/js/main.js'></script>
</head>
<body class='site'>
  <header class='nav-panel'>
    <div class='nav-inner'>
      <a class='brand' href='index.html'>
        <div class='logo-blob' aria-hidden='true'></div>
        <div class='brand-text'>
          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <span class='tagline'>{{TAGLINE}}</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav class='main-nav' aria-label='Primary navigation'>
        <button id='navToggle' class='nav-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='navMenu'>Menu</button>
        <ul id='navMenu' class='nav-list' hidden>
          <li><a href='index.html'>Home</a></li>
          <li><a href='services.html'>Sessions</a></li>
          <li><a href='blends.html'>Aromatic Blends</a></li>
          <li><a href='shop.html'>Shop</a></li>
          <li><a href='pricing.html'>Investment</a></li>
          <li><a href='about.html'>Story</a></li>
          <li><a class='cta' href='book.html'>Book {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</a></li>
          <li><a href='contact.html'>Connect</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <a class='phone-link' href='tel:{{PHONE}}' aria-label='Call us'>{{PHONE}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class='page'>
    <section id='hero' class='panel hero glass'>
      <svg class='pattern' aria-hidden='true'><use href='assets/img/pattern.svg#pattern'/></svg>
      <div class='hero-inner'>
        <h1>Thoughtful aromatherapy for everyday balance</h1>
        <p class='lead'>A safety-first, evidence-aware approach to aromatic work — blends, guidance, and a focused VIP Day to build rituals that fit your life.</p>
        <div class='hero-actions'>
          <a class='btn primary' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class='btn ghost' href='services.html'>See services</a>
        </div>
        <p class='meta'>Virtual + in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — sessions by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='social-proof' class='panel social glass'>
      <h2>What clients notice first</h2>
      <div class='testimonials'>
        <figure class='test'>
          <blockquote>'The VIP Day helped me ditch overwhelm and build a simple ritual. Practical, safe, and surprisingly calming.' </blockquote>
          <figcaption>— A. Rivera, designer</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='test'>
          <blockquote>'Clear guidance on dilution and pets made me feel confident using blends at home.' </blockquote>
          <figcaption>— M. Chen, parent</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='stat'>
          <div class='num'>98%</div>
          <div class='label'>report safer at-home use after a session</div>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='benefits' class='panel benefits glass'>
      <h2>Practical benefits we focus on</h2>
      <ul class='benefit-grid'>
        <li>
          <h3>Clear guidance</h3>
          <p>Personalized plans for safe dilution, storage, and scent layering so it fits your household and routine.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Simple rituals</h3>
          <p>Step-by-step practices you can keep for mornings, focus, or evening wind-downs — no jargon, just usable tools.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Blend confidence</h3>
          <p>Education about notes and pairings so you can mix scents that work together and remain safety-forward.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id='process' class='panel process glass'>
      <h2>How the VIP Day works</h2>
      <ol class='process-steps'>
        <li>
          <strong>Pre-work</strong>
          <p>Share preferences, household considerations, and any safety flags (pets, pregnancy, meds) via our intake form.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Deep session</strong>
          <p>Half-day with aroma profile testing, guided blending, and hands-on demo of dilution and application methods.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Toolkit</strong>
          <p>Receive a customized blend formula, a written safety plan, and a simple at-home ritual you can repeat.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Follow-up</strong>
          <p>30-day check-in to refine blends and answer questions — safety-first adjustments as needed.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section id='faq' class='panel faq glass'>
      <h2>Frequently asked safety questions</h2>
      <div class='faq-list'>
        <details>
          <summary>How should I dilute essential oils?</summary>
          <div class='answer'>Dilution guidance is individualized, but a common safe starting point is 1–2% for adults in topical blends. We always review age, medical history, and skin sensitivity before recommending dilution. This is educational guidance and not medical advice.</div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Do I need to do a patch test?</summary>
          <div class='answer'>Yes. We recommend a patch test on forearm skin (diluted blend) and observing for 24 hours. Stop if irritation occurs. We will walk you through patch testing during sessions.</div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>What about pets and essential oils?</summary>
          <div class='answer'>Many oils can affect animals differently. We prioritize pet-safe alternatives and diffusion practices that keep pets safe: short diffusion windows, pet-free rooms, and ventilation. Always consult your veterinarian for pet medical concerns.</div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Is aromatherapy safe during pregnancy?</summary>
          <div class='answer'>Pregnancy requires extra caution. Some oils and doses are not recommended. We provide pregnancy-safe alternatives and will adapt protocols; we do not provide medical advice and recommend consulting your care provider for specific health questions.</div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>How should I store oils?</summary>
          <div class='answer'>Store in dark glass, away from heat and direct light, out of reach of children. Label blends with dilution and date; best practice is to refresh blends every 6–12 months depending on oil chemistry.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='lead-magnet' class='panel lead glass'>
      <h2>Get the Aromatherapy Quick-Start Guide</h2>
      <p>Free PDF: clear dilution charts, a 5-minute diffuser recipe, and a patch-test checklist. Safety-first and practical.</p>
      <form id='leadForm' class='lead-form' method='post' action='#'>
        <label for='email'>Email</label>
        <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='you@example.com' required>
        <button type='submit' class='btn primary'>Send me the guide</button>
        <p class='small'>We respect your privacy. You can unsubscribe anytime. By signing up you agree to receive email from {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.</p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section id='final-cta' class='panel cta glass'>
      <h2>Ready to book a VIP Day?</h2>
      <p>One focused day to build safe blends and a ritual you will actually keep.</p>
      <div class='cta-actions'>
        <a class='btn primary large' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a class='btn ghost' href='book.html'>Schedule a consultation</a>
      </div>
      <p class='contact-small'>Questions? Email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class='site-footer'>
    <div class='footer-inner'>
      <p>© <span id='year'></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Practical aromatherapy, ethically sourced. Not medical advice.</p>
      <nav class='footer-nav'>
        <a href='about.html'>About</a>
        <a href='privacy.html'>Privacy</a>
        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>"} 
